{"version":1,"content":"<img src=\"https://fs.mingpao.com/ins/20260507/s00005/233690aae3fd49de9cbee8e94f538062.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:1em\"><p>韓國首爾高等法院刑事審判庭今（7日）就前國務總理韓悳洙從事內亂重要任務案進行二審判決，判處韓悳洙有期徒刑15年；</p><p>量刑較一審的23年減少8年。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T05:11:15.614789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":1,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-empty"}}